---
import DesignLayout from '../layouts/DesignLayout.astro';
---
<DesignLayout section="Operating System" title="Content Engine" focus="How does GreenSquare produce repeatable content without starting from zero each time?">
  <section class="ops-section ops-intro"><p class="ops-kicker">Production system</p><h2>One judgement principle. One operator tension. One useful method.</h2><p>The Content Engine turns the Judgment OS and Social System into repeatable production. It prevents content from becoming disconnected commentary by forcing every piece back to a judgement principle, a recognisable decision tension and a concrete change in how the reader acts.</p></section>
  <section class="ops-section"><div class="ops-heading"><span>01</span><h2>Input contract</h2></div><div class="ops-grid">{['Source idea or principle','Target audience','Decision tension','Channel','Desired action','Evidence available','CTA, if any'].map((x,i)=><article class="ops-card"><span>{String(i+1).padStart(2,'0')}</span><h3>{x}</h3></article>)}</div></section>
  <section class="ops-section"><div class="ops-heading"><span>02</span><h2>Production pipeline</h2></div><ol class="ops-flow">{['Select one judgement principle','Translate it into a recognisable operator tension','Reframe the visible task as a decision problem','Give one usable question, distinction, test or next action','Show how the method changes the decision','Adapt to the channel role','Apply evidence discipline','Use conversion only when earned','Run the publishing gate'].map((x,i)=><li><span>{String(i+1).padStart(2,'0')}</span><strong>{x}</strong></li>)}</ol></section>
  <section class="ops-section"><div class="ops-heading"><span>03</span><h2>Launch backbone</h2></div><div class="ops-weeks"><article><span>Week 1</span><h3>Frame the real decision</h3><p>Why better analysis cannot rescue the wrong frame. What exactly are you deciding, and why now?</p></article><article><span>Week 2</span><h3>Widen the option set</h3><p>False binaries, missing options, status quo, defer, sequence differently, partner or reduce commitment.</p></article><article><span>Week 3</span><h3>Find the critical assumption</h3><p>What belief is carrying the recommendation? What would have to be true? What evidence would reverse the call?</p></article><article><span>Week 4</span><h3>Separate evidence and move</h3><p>GIVEN, DERIVED, INFERRED and UNKNOWN, then convert analysis into an owner, date and evidence-producing next step.</p></article></div></section>
  <section class="ops-section ops-dark"><p class="ops-kicker">Learning loop</p><h2>Performance data may improve hooks, examples and formats. It must not rewrite the doctrine merely to chase engagement.</h2></section>
</DesignLayout>
<style>.ops-section{padding:clamp(3rem,6vw,6rem);border-top:1px solid var(--design-line)}.ops-intro{display:grid;grid-template-columns:.65fr 1fr;gap:3rem}.ops-intro h2,.ops-dark h2{font-size:clamp(2.2rem,4vw,4rem);line-height:1.03;margin:0;letter-spacing:-.03em}.ops-intro p:last-child{font-size:1.15rem;line-height:1.65}.ops-kicker,.ops-heading span,.ops-card>span,.ops-flow span,.ops-weeks span{font-size:.75rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--design-muted)}.ops-heading{display:grid;grid-template-columns:4rem 1fr;margin-bottom:2.5rem}.ops-heading h2{margin:0;font-size:2.2rem}.ops-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);border-top:1px solid var(--design-line);border-left:1px solid var(--design-line)}.ops-card{padding:1.5rem;border-right:1px solid var(--design-line);border-bottom:1px solid var(--design-line);min-height:9rem}.ops-card h3{margin:2rem 0 0;font-size:1.1rem}.ops-flow{list-style:none;padding:0;margin:0;border-top:1px solid var(--design-line)}.ops-flow li{display:grid;grid-template-columns:4rem 1fr;padding:1.2rem 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--design-line)}.ops-weeks{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);border-top:1px solid var(--design-line);border-left:1px solid var(--design-line)}.ops-weeks article{padding:1.6rem;border-right:1px solid var(--design-line);border-bottom:1px solid var(--design-line);min-height:13rem}.ops-weeks h3{font-size:1.5rem;margin:2rem 0 .8rem}.ops-weeks p{color:var(--design-muted);line-height:1.55}.ops-dark{background:var(--design-rail);color:white}.ops-dark .ops-kicker{color:rgba(255,255,255,.55)}@media(max-width:850px){.ops-intro,.ops-grid,.ops-weeks{grid-template-columns:1fr}}</style>